; Synthetic survey whose block holds case pairs under *case preserve: cavern
; labels its stations pairs.P1, pairs.P2, pairs.p1 and pairs.p2, with P1/p1
; and P2/p2 30 m apart. The anonymous outer block keeps the *case setting from
; reaching whatever follows the *include. Nothing fixes it.
*begin
*case preserve
*begin pairs
*data normal from to tape compass clino
P1 P2 10 90 0
P1 p1 30 0 0
p1 p2 10 90 0
*end pairs
*end
